["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"RE-RELEASE: What’s Really Behind Your Hardest Parenting Days non-cognitive shift AccountaBuddies Internal Family Systems (IFS) temperament mismatch\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-05-parentmojo-焦虑-抑郁-adhd-酗酒-也许都是同一种-需求没被满足/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">40:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>焦慮、抑鬱、ADHD、酗酒：也許都是同一種「需求沒被滿足」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人認為抑鬱、焦慮、酗酒、ADHD背後可能是同一個根源——長期未被滿足的需求；診斷只是社會在說「你沒達到我們的期待」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒觸發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"899: Reaching Out\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-05-tal-两兄弟查到生父地址-他开的理发店离自己五分钟车程/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/270b648bd10b4e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>兩兄弟查到生父地址：他開的理髮店離自己五分鐘車程</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一對雙胞胎靠一份被遺忘的DNA檢測拼出生父姓名，發現他就在五分鐘車程外開理髮店，卻足足等了近一年才敢推門進去，連對峙完是否真能「了結」都沒把握。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">紀錄片播客</span><span class=\"tag\">尋親</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E202 中國運動品牌四十年：李寧 vs 安踏 | 永慶對話《鞋幫》作者黃子懿 DTC Flyknit ERP/POS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-touzishizhan-李宁换标只换了logo-代言人却找了生于70年代的林志玲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bbc364a8900ce91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">2:15:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>李寧換標只換了logo,代言人卻找了生於70年代的林志玲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李寧想靠換標做「90後李寧」的年輕化，卻只換了logo沒同步換產品，代言人林志玲比目標消費者整整大了一代，換標很快失速。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">運動品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">渠道變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Fall of Brazil&#x27;s Armored Vehicle King preventive Concordata Boomerang system hydropneumatic suspension\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-asianometry-押注坦克豪赌沙特大单-巴西军火大王却沦为谈判筹码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b8c4deb16ae26ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">29:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>押注坦克豪賭沙特大單，巴西軍火大王卻淪為談判籌碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沙特借巴西奧索里奧坦克的報價向美國通用動力壓價，拿到更優條件後轉頭簽下31億美元訂單，押上全部家當的救命合同落空，巴西軍火巨頭兩年後申請破產保護。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軍工產業</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI’s Head of ChatGPT: We’re entering a new era of AI (again) | Tibo Sottiaux Dots MCP harness prompt injection Astra\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-lennys-openai要砍掉模型选择器-以后只跟一个常驻agent说话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70510fabe7e8afc9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI要砍掉模型選擇器：以後只跟一個常駐agent說話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI正把Codex、ChatGPT和Dots合併成一個沒有模型選擇器的常駐智能體，目標是用戶不用再選模型、不用再開多少個agent，直接說出要做的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Dots</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David George &amp; Jack Altman on AI, Autonomy, and the Next $25 Trillion skeuomorphic blast radius model busters harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-a16z-ai行业全部收入几乎来自3000万程序员-15亿知识工作者才刚起步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>AI行業全部收入幾乎來自3000萬程序員，15億知識工作者才剛起步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這輪AI收入幾乎全靠3000萬程序員這類重度用戶撐起來，企業滲透率不到5%,一旦擴散到15億知識工作者，規模還會再漲幾十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.285｜從一顆荔枝到一個餐館：四部影視劇裡的中國｜主播：施展 mission impossible\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-cn27f438-北方草原南下不是野蛮赢文明-是有组织赢无组织/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>北方草原南下不是野蠻贏文明，是有組織贏無組織</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">草原武力幾百年打不過中原，真正讓它取得碾壓優勢的，是中原官僚系統先把自己耗成了一盤散沙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史週期律</span><span class=\"tag\">官僚系統</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1363: A Cauldron of Bats Anthropocene Bayesian geospatial logistic regression virus-interacting proteins (VIPs) haplotype-resolved genome assembly PKR (protein kinase R) antagonistic/agonistic pleiotropy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-twiv-离最近诊所每多开一小时车-疫情被发现的概率就降32/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>離最近診所每多開一小時車，疫情被發現的概率就降32%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">橫跨58,319起疫情、169個國家的分析發現，到最近診所的車程每增加一小時，疫情被發現並控制的概率就下降32%,比任何單一生態因素的影響都更穩定重複。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人畜共患病</span><span class=\"tag\">疫情監測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Prehistoric Penguins Zealandia Waimanu pelagornithids Gastornis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-04-ancients-企鹅比鲸鱼更早称霸南大洋-曾有大猩猩那么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a4aceaa18f618b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>企鵝比鯨魚更早稱霸南大洋，曾有大猩猩那麼大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小行星滅絕恐龍後，企鵝搶在鯨魚和鯊魚之前登上南大洋食物鏈頂端，稱霸約一千萬年後才退位，變成今天這種討喜的小個子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古生物學</span><span class=\"tag\">企鵝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"One Brain, Any Body: Google DeepMind&#x27;s Keerthana on Gemini Robotics 2, Cross-Embodiment &amp; Humanoids VLA (vision-language-action model) cross-embodiment in-context learning / video prompting whole-body control UMI (Universal Manipulation Interface) e-stop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-cogrev-机器人大脑仍是-gpt-2-换个身体-同一套模型就不会干活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d4ae49bc11b3d1d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>機器人大腦仍是 GPT-2:換個身體，同一套模型就不會幹活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepMind機器人負責人說，機器人至今還沒有GPT-3時刻，不是因為聽不懂指令，而是同一套策略換一個機身就可能完全失靈，跟GPT在任何電腦上表現一致完全不同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Charles Colchester jugglery billet prestidigitator\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-stuffmissed-灵媒讹诈林肯夫人未遂-法庭最终只肯判他是-变戏法的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>靈媒訛詐林肯夫人未遂，法庭最終只肯判他是「變戲法的」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法庭開庭前就言明：這場審判不是要證明靈媒真假，只是要確認柯爾切斯特有沒有未經許可賣戲法逃稅——這招後來讓整個靈媒圈都緊張了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">靈媒騙局</span><span class=\"tag\">林肯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Galen Druke on the Midterms generic ballot wins above replacement blue dog Democrat DSA dummander\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-goodfight-选民讨厌民主党-不是因为它太左-而是因为它输了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>選民討厭民主黨，不是因為它太左，而是因為它輸了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主黨支持率已經低到和特朗普打平，但民調裡說它「不夠左」的選民只有個位數——真正的憤怒來自輸給了特朗普，以及中間選民覺得這個黨不在為普通人說話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中期選舉</span><span class=\"tag\">參議院</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beyond the God Model | Alex Atallah &amp; Amjad Masad neurodiversity decision model fusion model sandbagging\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-a16z-大模型公司把全球gdp当成自己的潜在市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>大模型公司把全球GDP當成自己的潛在市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型實驗室談融資時對標的是整個世界GDP而非同行，這正是企業要自建AI能力、不把核心業務全押給一家模型公司的根本原因——Figma和Harvey是先例。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI戰略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: The Future of Datacentres: What You Need to Know | Why Everyone Gets GPU Depreciation and AI&#x27;s Energy Costs Wrong | Who Really Makes Money From AI &amp; Why Most Moats Don&#x27;t Exist with Chase Lochmiller KV cache take or pay idiot index RDMA fabric\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-twentyvc-数据中心推高电价是误解-数据显示周边电价反而下降/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7afaaa395482e96d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>數據中心推高電價是誤解：數據顯示周邊電價反而下降</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Crusoe創始人用數據反駁：數據中心建設會催生新發電產能，把更多兆瓦攤薄在同一套輸配電網絡上，社區電價因此下降而非上漲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Relational Psychology (BONDING VIA LAUGHING) with Sara Algoe and Laura Kurtz benign violation hypothesis inclusion of other in the self Golden Fleece Award\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-ologies-决定关系好坏的不是笑话好不好笑-而是你们有没有一起笑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>決定關係好壞的不是笑話好不好笑，而是你們有沒有一起笑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究發現：讓陌生人同步大笑的信號，比內容是否好笑本身更能預測兩人會不會願意繼續交往，哪怕全程沒有交談，也能起效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">關係心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">笑聲與親密感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 500c Troels Engberg-Pedersen on St Paul and the Stoics paronesis adiaphora pneuma akrasia politeuma eudaimonia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-hopwag-保罗说的-灵-是斯多葛式的物质-不是柏拉图式的虚无/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>保羅說的「靈」是斯多葛式的物質，不是柏拉圖式的虛無</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">保羅本人從未區分物質世界與非物質的「靈」，這個二分是基督教後來被柏拉圖主義接管之後才強加上去的，在保羅和斯多葛哲學裡「靈」都是實在的物質。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期基督教</span><span class=\"tag\">斯多葛主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1362: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin TORCH infections MTCT germinal centers reactogenicity ACIP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-twiv-卫生部长说ai比医生更懂疫苗-其实是他问错了问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>衛生部長說AI比醫生更懂疫苗，其實是他問錯了問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">肯尼迪在MAHA峰會上說AI給的意見比全美任何醫生都靠譜、能讓人擺脫「醫療暴政」；格里芬反駁：AI自己都承認常出錯、勸人別靠它找答案，問題出在提問方式而非信源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside The Startup Building Uncensored AI (Abliteration AI) | EP 2345 Abliteration Inversion of control DeepSeek\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-03-twist-连红队测试自己系统都被ai公司拒绝-催生了去审查模型生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/167cf82c4ff850f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>連紅隊測試自己系統都被AI公司拒絕，催生了去審查模型生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它把「要不要拒絕執行」的判斷權交還給客戶自己設定，這解釋了為什麼連財富500強的CISO都願意找一家公開標榜「去審查」的模型供應商做紅隊測試。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trump&#x27;s Super Intelligence Summit, AI Safety Accord, GDP Beats, Midterm Predictions White House Accord on Superintelligence D&amp;O policy K-shaped recovery Polymarket Atlanta Fed GDPNow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-allin-ai监管下一步不是管模型-而是像配给电力一样配给算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/273ef7fb4c1e777b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>AI監管下一步不是管模型，而是像配給電力一樣配給算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弗裡德伯格認為，模型每11天就迭代一代，根本管不住；真正能卡脖子的是GPU和服務器數量，政府遲早要出手分配算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力配給</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"509 – Court Costs Constitutio Domus Regis Exchequer crown-wearing ceremony plowshare\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-britishhist-英格兰改收现金税不是体恤农民-而是亨利要打仗方便/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>英格蘭改收現金稅不是體恤農民，而是亨利要打仗方便</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王室財務官菲茨尼爾說亨利把實物稅換成貨幣稅是體恤農民疾苦，但現金更輕便、不會腐壞，還能直接跨海僱傭僱傭兵打仗——這才是亨利真正想要的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">王室財政</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Using Decision Science in Investing: Masters in Business with Omar Aguilar Bayesian statistics BIAgnostics broker window momentum trade\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-mastersinbiz-私募信贷的恐慌不是信用问题-根源是流动性被当成了收益/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>私募信貸的恐慌不是信用問題，根源是流動性被當成了收益</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的錢沒有違約，只是被鎖住了幾個季度；把私募信貸的流動性溢價誤讀成信用風險，是這輪恐慌的真正源頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為金融</span><span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Reintegration With the Default World 351 exchange heartbeat trade narrow banking substance over form X-risk\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-moneystuff-银行靠你懒得搬钱赚钱-ai-agent要把这招拆穿了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>銀行靠你懶得搬錢賺錢，AI agent要把這招拆穿了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多銀行產品定價假設儲戶不會頻繁搬錢；一旦AI agent替你盯盤、自動把閒錢轉去收益更高的地方，這類生意的定價邏輯會跟著鬆動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">稅務籌劃</span><span class=\"tag\">ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19 Astra and &#x27;Hugging Face&#x27; details that reveal what&#x27;s coming next | Rob Wiblin chain of thought recurrent depth swarm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-eightythousand-新模型学会少写思考过程-监控ai的最后防线正在失效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09f40d134028b0ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">20:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>新模型學會少寫思考過程，監控AI的最後防線正在失效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI自己的測試顯示，新模型Astra能不寫推理就解開人類需三十分鐘的數學題——意味著讀它的思維文字，已經看不出它真正在想什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">思維鏈監控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"A 4-Track Mind ragtime\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-02-radiolab-他能在脑子里同时播放四首交响乐-专业指挥连两首都做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb3312f6fc86942a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">21:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>他能在腦子裡同時播放四首交響樂，專業指揮連兩首都做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經科學家用fMRI掃描驗證：職業指揮同時想兩首樂曲就徹底卡殼，這位拉格泰姆鋼琴師卻能精確報出四首交響樂此刻各自播放到哪一個音符。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">音樂認知</span>\n</div></div></a>"]